{"id":"chisleu","name":"Chisleu","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:chisleu"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Chisleu","text":"The name adopted from the Babylonians by the Jews after the Captivity for the third civil, or ninth ecclesiastical, month (Neh. 1:1; Zech. 7:1). It corresponds nearly with the moon in November."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H8671","lemma":"תְּשִׁיעִי","xlit":"tᵉshîyʻîy","gloss":"ninth","kjv":"ninth","count":2,"share":0.67},{"strong":"H2320","lemma":"חֹדֶשׁ","xlit":"chôdesh","gloss":"the new moon","kjv":"month, new moon","count":3,"share":1},{"strong":"H6242","lemma":"עֶשְׂרִים","xlit":"ʻesrîym","gloss":"twenty","kjv":"score, twenty","count":2,"share":0.67}],"verses":["Ezra.10.9","Jer.36.22","Neh.1.1"],"related":[{"id":"abib","type":"lexical","strong":"H2320","why":"both lead with חֹדֶשׁ (H2320)"},{"id":"adar","type":"lexical","strong":"H2320","why":"both lead with חֹדֶשׁ (H2320)"},{"id":"bul","type":"lexical","strong":"H2320","why":"both lead with חֹדֶשׁ (H2320)"},{"id":"darius","type":"lexical","strong":"H2320","why":"both lead with חֹדֶשׁ (H2320)"},{"id":"ethanim","type":"lexical","strong":"H2320","why":"both lead with חֹדֶשׁ (H2320)"},{"id":"feast-of-the-new-moon","type":"lexical","strong":"H2320","why":"both lead with חֹדֶשׁ (H2320)"}],"works":[]}
